      "ArticleTitle": "Acute peripheral administration of synthetic human GLP-1 (7-36 amide) decreases circulating IL-6 in obese patients with type 2 diabetes mellitus: a potential role for GLP-1 in modulation of the diabetic pro-inflammatory state?",
